control_cli_events {"model": "gpt-6-luna", "events": "{\"type\":\"thread.started\",\"thread_id\":\"01a1674d-1ca8-7292-97da-1540a0636259\"}\n{\"type\":\"turn.started\"}\n{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"task_summary\\\":\\\"Implement a typed interval-union API in solution.py and add standard-library unittest coverage in test_solution.py for ordinary, boundary, and empty inputs; verify using unittest discovery.\\\",\\\"constraints\\\":[\\\"Work only within the supplied task workspace; do not access parent repositories or external services.\\\",\\\"Use Python 3.11+ and the standard library.\\\",\\\"Merge overlapping or touching closed intervals, sorted by start; raise ValueError if any start is greater than its end; return [] for empty input; do not mutate the input.\\\",\\\"Maintain type hints and retain the stated behavior and compatibility requirements.\\\",\\\"Include at least two passing unittest methods in test_solution.py that exercise the public API.\\\"],\\\"success_criteria\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-1\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"solution.py compiles successfully.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"command\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m py_compile solution.py\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-2\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"test_solution.py compiles successfully.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"command\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m py_compile test_solution.py\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-3\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"test_solution.py contains at least two unittest test method definitions.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"regex\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"test_solution.py\\\",\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"(?m)^\\\\\\\\s+def test_[A-Za-z0-9_]+\\\\\\\\s*\\\\\\\\(\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-4\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The unittest suite passes with verbose discovery.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"command\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m unittest discover -v\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-5\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The solution exposes a typed union function that merges overlapping or touching intervals in start order, rejects reversed intervals with ValueError, returns an empty list for empty input, and does not mutate input.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"llm_judge\\\",\\\"rubric\\\":\\\"Read solution.py and assess whether it provides a type-hinted public API for interval union that merges overlapping or touching closed intervals in sorted start order, raises ValueError when any start is greater than its end, returns [] for empty input, and does not mutate input collections. Judge only what is supported by the file contents.\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-6\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The tests exercise the public API with ordinary, boundary, and empty inputs and check the specified behavior, including input immutability and invalid intervals.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"llm_judge\\\",\\\"rubric\\\":\\\"Read test_solution.py and assess whether it contains at least two unittest test methods that exercise the public API, covering ordinary interval merging, boundary behavior such as touching intervals, empty input, reversed interval rejection, and input immutability. Assess coverage visible in the test file without claiming the tests ran.\\\"}}],\\\"verification\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m py_compile solution.py\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m py_compile test_solution.py\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m unittest discover -v\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}],\\\"stop_conditions\\\":[],\\\"assumptions\\\":[\\\"The named files are relative to the supplied task workspace; they may not exist yet and may be created.\\\",\\\"The public function name and exact input/output interval representation are unspecified; their selection and any mapping required by the